  "description": "SI-HYUN works in the HR department of a large corporation. He knew nothing but work, but now he's in a crisis. \"I'm a woman?!\" Infected by TSVID, he is now a woman, and in a child's body as well. The body may be small, but the intelligence is still there! A second chance at life unfolds in a girl's body.\n\n(Source: DAYcomics)",
